# Phase 9 Implementation Plan — User Roles & Owner Dashboard

## Goal
Implement a three-tier role system (`visitor`, `owner`, `admin`) with backend authorization guards, role-selection cards during sign-up, and a dedicated Owner Dashboard.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - Users with role `visitor` (formerly `user`) cannot create/edit/delete cafés.
> - Users with role `owner` can submit new cafés, but can only edit/delete cafés where `createdBy === user._id`.
> - Existing `admin` role maintains full administrative rights across all models.

